{"id":"jahrhundert","lemma":"Jahrhundert","pos":"noun","rank":2027,"glosses":["a century (period of 100 years)"],"ipa":"/jaːɐ̯ˈhʊndɐt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b4/De-Jahrhundert.ogg/De-Jahrhundert.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Jahrhunderts","plural":"Jahrhunderte"},"formAudio":{"Jahrhunderts":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Jahrhunderts.wav","Jahrhunderte":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Jahrhunderte.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ein Jahrhundert hat hundert Jahre.","en":"A century is one hundred years.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/592899","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"one hundred"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"}]},{"text":"Er wurde im 19. Jahrhundert geboren.","en":"He was born in the 19th century.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to give birth","l":"gebären"}]},{"text":"Ein Jahrtausend umfasst zehn Jahrhunderte.","en":"A millennium comprises ten centuries.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"millennium"},{"g":"encompassed"},{"g":"ten"},null]},{"text":"Dieser Brauch geht ins zwölfte Jahrhundert zurück.","en":"This custom dates back to the 12th century.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"custom"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"into the"},{"g":"twelfth"},null,{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Meine Großeltern wurden im letzten Jahrhundert geboren.","en":"My grandparents were born in the last century.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"grandparents"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"the last one","l":"Letzter"},null,{"g":"to give birth","l":"gebären"}]}]}